Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:41.30,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}弾けるように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:46.01,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}好きという文字が躍る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.43,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}顔や声を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:52.23,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}想うだけで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:57.15,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}居ても立ってもいられない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:23:01.82,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}こんな気持ちになれるって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:06.91,09EDJP,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}僕はついているね
