Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.57,0:22:27.53,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}大聲響起的MUSIC
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.33,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}正在無限循環
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.08,0:22:38.75,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}就像爆米花
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.75,0:22:41.30,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}劈啪綻放那樣
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.30,0:22:46.01,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}「喜歡」的字樣在跳躍著
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.43,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}你的臉龐與聲音
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.43,0:22:52.23,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}僅僅只是回想起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.23,0:22:57.15,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}就讓我坐立難安
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.48,0:23:01.82,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}能夠體會到這種心情
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.82,0:23:06.91,09EDCHT,ED,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\blur4}我真是超幸運呢
